    "title": "Arrington Statement on Tragic Death of Charlie Kirk | U.S. Representative Jodey Arrington",
    "text": "Arrington Statement on Tragic Death of Charlie Kirk\nWashington,\nSeptember 10, 2025\n,\nWASHINGTON, D.C. – House Budget Chairman Jodey Arrington (TX-19) issued the following statement mourning the tragic death of Charlie Kirk: “What happened to Charlie Kirk is horribly sad and deeply disturbing,” said Chairman Arrington. “He wasn’t just a fearless advocate for faith, family, and freedom, but, most importantly, a devoted husband, father, and son. Please join me in praying for Charlie’s family.” ### |",
